window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Okay, so things have gotten a little bit crazy around here.</p> <p>The good news is, we know what we’re up against now.</p> <p>The bad news? I don’t know if we stand a chance.</p> <p><i>Magic Gambit</i> is the final book in the Hidden World Academy series, a medium-burn reverse harem story intended for ages 18+, featuring a sassy human who's a little out of her depth and the three men who win her heart.</p>"; 
